- **accel_0_60_sec**: 0-60 mph times range from 9.1s (2.0 CDTi 165PS) to 10.6s (2.0 CDTi 130PS) or 9.9s (1.4T). These times are slower than the market average of 7.5s. Score: -0.50.
- **top_speed**: Top speeds range from 119 mph (2.0 CDTi 130PS) to 129 mph (2.0 CDTi 165PS) or 124 mph (1.4T). These are below the market average of 150 mph. Score: -0.50.
